{
  "version": 1,
  "_doc": "The Discover catalogs of the v2 family (Marco, 22/10/2026: countries & regions, decades & eras, and the lists by subject). The order of `options` is the menu's. A calculated option has exactly one of `where` (lib/moods.js, on the film's own TMDB record), `country` (the country of the card: index column `country`, else the first of `countries`) or `decade` (index `decade`); a list option is `{ list }` and its label is the list's `short`. Every list of config.json is in exactly one catalog (lib/discover-catalogs.js refuses a build otherwise). The menus are frozen: a change here changes the manifest and needs the addon reinstalled. `source` is for the reader of the file, the build ignores it. The countries are the ones with 20 or more films that he has not seen and that recommend, counted on the offline build of 22/10/2026 (Greece has exactly 20: the build warns with ! when a country of this list falls under the floor, and keeps it).",
  "decided": "Marco, 22/10/2026 (questionnaire, spec section 9): (1) a) the lists in subject catalogs, 8 new ones; Lists and Lists (unseen) leave the manifest. (2) a) each list shows what he has not seen, with the filter Include seen. (3) the rule of the country of a film is POSTPONED by him (\"deixa paara dps\", ~18:50 UTC, after (a) \"eh o 1 mas topsy turvy eh british\" and two \"Segura\"): the countries of this file use the rule of today, the country of the film's facts (lib/discover-catalogs.js countryOf), until he decides. (4) c) a country needs 20 films, 36 countries. (5) b) 11 regions: the 8 of the Board with Asia split into East Asia and Southeast Asia, plus Oceania and Iberia; India is a country only. (6) b) the 20 eras of the table plus the 7 optional ones, 27 eras; a music film is shown only with evidence (the rule is in the Worker for every cut, PR #74). Also decided: the TSPDT directors stay as data, no catalog of them; the five TSPDT lists (the 4 of PR #72 and the Beyond the Sight & Sound A-List) are in Critics & awards.",
  "floor": {"countries":20,"eras":20},
  "order": ["moods","places","eras","genres","themes","critics","filmmaker-picks","director-picks","friends","letterboxd","seasons","explore","search"],
  "retire": ["lists","lists-unseen"],
  "seen": {"name":"seen","option":"Include seen"},
  "spread": {"per":2,"perAfterFirstPage":5,"window":20},
